# Secure output staging: allowlist only candidate reproducibility files;
# confirm formal disclosure approval before publication
sail_sdc/outputs/*
!sail_sdc/outputs/README.md
!sail_sdc/outputs/paf_dprv_count.xlsx
!sail_sdc/outputs/paf_dprv_dms.xlsx
